      "locale": "en-US",
      "capturedAt": "2026-09-08T13:12:58.292Z",
      "copy": {
        "fullDescription": "A photo. A little note. Stillstamp.\n\nA person you love, a sunset, a cat at home. Turn a favorite photo into a textured postcard with your own words.\n\nStart with a photo\nChoose a photo from your device and adjust its composition. Generate a stamp-inspired postcard image based on your photo.\n\nMake it your own\nChoose a postcard-only layout or place the original photo beside it. Adjust the size and position of the photo and stamp, then add a date and a short message.\n\nSave and share\nSave your finished postcard as an image or share it. Find the postcards you have made in your library.\n\nBefore you begin\nImage generation requires an internet connection and credits. Your selected photo is sent to an external server for generation. Results can vary with the photo and request. Screens marked SAMPLE are examples, separate from generated results.\nThe app contains ads and in-app purchases. Manage your credits and account in Profile.\n\nSupport: help@akra.kr\nPrivacy policy: https://stillstamp.akra.kr/privacy",
        "name": "Stillstamp",
        "shortDescription": "Turn a photo and a short note into a textured postcard to save and share"
      },
